cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "2026: Public F1 telemetry data"
abstract: >-
  Free, public Formula 1 telemetry and timing data for the 2026 season:
  car telemetry, lap times, weather, race control messages, team radio,
  driver and circuit/corner data for every session of each Grand Prix
  weekend. Generated from the official Formula 1 live timing data with
  the open-source FastF1 library.
authors:
  - name: TracingInsights
    website: "https://tracinginsights.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TracingInsights/2026"
url: "https://github.com/TracingInsights/2026"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: 2026-02-11
keywords:
  - Formula 1
  - F1
  - motorsport
  - telemetry
  - lap times
  - FastF1
  - dataset
